    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43419" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐαπάλλακτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easy to get rid of</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππος</span> (i.e. <i>finding a
				ready sale</i>) <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				3.1
			</span></i>; -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ότερον πάθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					883a18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				6.38.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				13.3
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τως</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἔχειν</span> to be <i>easy to
			evacuate</i>, of a position, <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				16.18
			</span></i>.</div>
